From: Codex Local <codex-local@localhost>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:35:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 16/22] Add Verdite-style keyboard and native mouse look for
 KFIV

Sample physical input on the window thread and publish synchronized pad snapshots, merge keyboard with controllers, and track cursor capture across gameplay, pause, inventory and common menus. Register instruction-checked USA game overrides that consume mouse displacement once at the native player look update. Include opt-in host input fixtures and diagnostics for integration tests; no generated game code or assets.
